# Lockfiles: pubspec.lock is tracked on purpose. It is what pins the plugin
# versions a release was built from — an untracked one let two machines
# resolve different androidx.datastore builds, and 1.1.12 shipped a native
# library without 16 KB page alignment as a result.
Podfile.lock
*.podspec.lock
*.dat

